# armour/woman/leather: studded leather cut to the woman (P2c slice, SLICE-ARMOUR; STYLE_P2 25.3): the man's cuirass on
# her torso, shaped by ONE step-1 row across the chest under the bust, the waist a pixel narrower (the tunic's waist column
# erased), her tunic's sleeve caps left showing (a sleeveless cuirass). Matte; a step-3 top edge, the stitch row, one shine on
# the lit shoulder; studs `when studs` as one course over the stitch row (i3). Keys: rest idle run runl drawn swing lie in D U R L.
# Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body woman
role armour leather
layer torso
anchor neck
keys torso
z 2

